OL,3,GNEWSA'Flawed' training contributed to
OL,4,Aofficer's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army officer's accidental death
OL,7,Fduring a training exercise was
OL,8,Fcontributed to by "flawed" training and
OL,9,Fa faulty alarm system, a coroner has
OL,10,Fconcluded.
OL,12,FSecond Lt Max George, 26, died on
OL,13,FSalisbury Plain after struggling with a
OL,14,Fpiece of "snagged" kit as he left a
OL,15,FWarrior armoured vehicle, which then
OL,16,Freversed into him, an inquest into his
OL,17,Fdeath heard.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
