OL,3,GNEWSA'Flawed' training contributed to
OL,4,Aofficer's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictoria Neale, who represented
OL,7,FGeorge's family, said the inquest
OL,8,Fprovided his loved ones with "important
OL,9,Fanswers" and provided a "degree of
OL,10,Faccountability".
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Defence (MOD) vowed to
OL,13,Frespond to points raised during the
OL,14,Finquest and said it had already made
OL,15,Fseveral safety improvements.
